# Model preference

When launching Task/subagents:
- Prefer the strongest available model while credits allow.
- If Claude / GPT / other premium credits are exhausted or the agent stalls on quota, use **`cursor-grok-4.6-high-fast`** (Grok).
- Do not keep retrying a failed/quota-blocked model — switch to Grok and continue the same task.
